# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command history
usage 1   history                       list previously executed commands, numbered
usage 2   history clear                 forget all recorded history
usage 3   !N / !!                       re-run history entry N / the last command (typed at the prompt)

case numbered entries and clearing
target none
covers 1-3
$ history
out 10
1  history
status 0
action none
$ echo a
out 1
a
status 0
action none
$ echo b
out 1
b
status 0
action none
$ history
out 41
1  history
2  echo a
3  echo b
4  history
status 0
action none
$ !2
out 1
a
status 0
action none
$ !!
out 1
a
status 0
action none
$ history clear
out 16
History cleared.
status 0
action none
$ history
out 10
1  history
status 0
action none
$ history extra
out 27
1  history
2  history extra
status 0
action none
end
